  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp; has dimension of energy</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>k</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is dimensionless</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#946;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#946;</mi></math> has dimensions of work</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi>MT</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>ML</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#945;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mi>LT</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
